I arrive at the office.
There is a lot of light in the office.
There are many people here.
I look around.
A colleague comes near me.
He smiles.
"Hello, I am Rohan," he says.
"Welcome to the company."
I smile too.
"Hello Rohan, I am Maya," I say.
"Nice to meet you."
He asks, "Maya, what is your team?"
I answer him.
"I work in the mobile app development team."
"I am a software engineer."
"That is great!" Rohan says.
"My team is different."
Rohan is very nice.
I feel very good on the first day.
